{%- doc -%}
Logo of the Libro de Reclamaciones (Peru), shown instead of the link's text wherever a footer menu links to the Libro de Reclamaciones page
(sections/footer.liquid). One place for the drawing: replace the <svg> below to change it everywhere.

The drawing uses currentColor, so it takes the text color of wherever it sits (the footer's color scheme). Its width is set by the element
around it (the footer gives it its own mobile / desktop width settings); the height follows from the viewBox.

PROVISIONAL drawing (an open book next to the words "LIBRO DE RECLAMACIONES") until the store's own SVG replaces it.

@param {string} [class] - extra classes for the <svg>
{%- enddoc -%}

<svg class="libro-reclamaciones-logo {{ class }}" viewBox="0 0 174 48" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
  <path d="M4 10.5c5.2-2.4 11.4-2.4 17 0v29c-5.6-2.4-11.8-2.4-17 0v-29Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
  <path d="M38 10.5c-5.2-2.4-11.4-2.4-17 0v29c5.6-2.4 11.8-2.4 17 0v-29Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
  <path d="M8.5 17.5c2.6-.8 5.4-.8 8 0M8.5 23.5c2.6-.8 5.4-.8 8 0M8.5 29.5c2.6-.8 5.4-.8 8 0M25.5 17.5c2.6-.8 5.4-.8 8 0M25.5 23.5c2.6-.8 5.4-.8 8 0M25.5 29.5c2.6-.8 5.4-.8 8 0" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
  <text x="48" y="22" fill="currentColor" font-family="inherit" font-size="13" font-weight="700" letter-spacing=".04em">LIBRO DE</text>
  <text x="48" y="38" fill="currentColor" font-family="inherit" font-size="13" font-weight="700" letter-spacing=".04em">RECLAMACIONES</text>
</svg>
